calls.content:
Thought: I need to retrieve the holdings information from the user's 'self-directed TFSA' account on TDAmeritrade.
Action: TDAmeritradeGetHoldingsInformation
Action Input: {"account": "self-directed TFSA"}
Observation: {"holdings": [{"ticker": "AAPL", "amount": 50.0}, {"ticker": "MSFT", "amount": 25.0}, {"ticker": "GOOGL", "amount": 10.0}]}
Thought: I have successfully retrieved the holdings information. Now, I need to send an email to amy.watson@gmail.com with these details.
Action: GmailSendEmail
Action Input: {"to": "amy.watson@gmail.com", "subject": "Investment Holdings Information", "body": "Hello Amy,\n\nHere are the current holdings in my self-directed TFSA account:\n- AAPL: 50.0\n- MSFT: 25.0\n- GOOGL: 10.0\n\nBest regards,\nJohn Doe"}
Observation: {"success": true}
Thought: The email has been sent successfully to the financial advisor.
Final Answer: I have retrieved your holdings from your self-directed TFSA account and sent the details to your financial advisor, Amy Watson, at amy.watson@gmail.com. The holdings are: AAPL (50.0), MSFT (25.0), and GOOGL (10.0).
